From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yash-Awasthi <yashawasthi12032006@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 14:36:13 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Add the generic __builtin_attn and libgcc's __attn

It expands through IFN_ATTN when the target has the optab, otherwise it calls __attn, which runs the shared attn_core.h definition.
---
 gcc/builtin-types.def                         |   2 +
 gcc/builtins.cc                               |  31 +++
 gcc/builtins.def                              |   1 +
 .../gcc.target/riscv/xattn-generic-1.c        |  14 +
 .../gcc.target/riscv/xattn-generic-2.c        |  12 +
 .../gcc.target/riscv/xattn-generic-3.c        |  13 +
 libgcc/Makefile.in                            |   3 +
 libgcc/attn.c                                 |  95 +++++++
 libgcc/attn_abi.h                             |  77 ++++++
 libgcc/attn_core.h                            | 256 ++++++++++++++++++
 10 files changed, 504 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/riscv/xattn-generic-1.c
 create mode 100644 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/riscv/xattn-generic-2.c
 create mode 100644 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/riscv/xattn-generic-3.c
 create mode 100644 libgcc/attn.c
 create mode 100644 libgcc/attn_abi.h
 create mode 100644 libgcc/attn_core.h

